* ADR1399H Precision 7.05V Buried-Zener Voltage Reference
* -------------------------------------------------------
* 15 V supply -> series bias resistor -> ADR1399H zener output (OUT)
* Output bypass capacitor + light (70 uA) load
*
* ADR1399H pin order in ADI model: (1) HEATER+  (2) CATHODE/OUT  (3) ANODE  (4) HEATER-
* -------------------------------------------------------

.include ADR1399H.cir

* ---------------- Supply ----------------
V1 IN 0 DC 15

* ------------- Bias network -------------
* Sets zener current: (15 - 7.05)/7.87k ~ 1.0 mA
R1 IN OUT 7.87k

* ------------ Reference device ----------
XREF IN OUT 0 0 ADR1399H

* --------- Output bypass and load -------
C1 OUT 0 1u
RL OUT 0 100k

* -------------- Analysis ----------------
.tran 0 100m 0 20u uic

.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 80m TO 100m
.meas TRAN izener AVG I(R1) FROM 80m TO 100m

.options plotwinsize=0 gmin=1e-12 reltol=1e-4
.end
